    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;HEY, YOUR TRUCK STILL OPEN?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on the clock\u00a0<strong>till midnight</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a <strong>food truck in the post-apocalypse</strong>, serving <strong>bizarre meals</strong> to even stranger customers. Each night, you\u2019ll <strong>balance cooking orders with staying alive</strong>\u2014dodging horrors, managing your nerves, and trying not to completely lose your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mess up too many orders, serve the wrong freaks, or let something slip past you, and stress will pile up fast. <strong>Hit your limit, and it\u2019s lights out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ac1eb4ae1a091c7b3b640ec303095ad3.poster.avif?t=1752533542\" width=500 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ac1eb4ae1a091c7b3b640ec303095ad3.webm?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ac1eb4ae1a091c7b3b640ec303095ad3.mp4?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;YOU GOT FOOD? I GOT MOUTH.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry weirdos</strong> are lining up, and it\u2019s your job to <strong>feed them</strong>. Toast, bowls, shish kebabs\u2014raw or cooked, rotten or radioactive\u2014you\u2019ll serve them all, no matter how freaky their faces or their appetites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all part of the gig. <strong>Keep your truck moving</strong>, <strong>survive each stop</strong>, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll make it to that legendary non-irradiated beach on the horizon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.poster.avif?t=1752533542\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.webm?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.mp4?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival <strong>cooking</strong> gameplay with a <strong>pressure-based stress system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable customers</strong> with weird requests and weirder appearances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0<strong>variety of wasteland locations</strong> with their own <strong>dangers and monsters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense</strong>, atmospheric <strong>gameplay</strong> with a <strong>darkly humorous</strong> tone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
