graph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.poster.avif?t=1752533542\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.webm?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748640/extras/ccc7352aedb4d604c71f41e1621316e3.mp4?t=1752533542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival <strong>cooking</strong> gameplay with a <strong>pressure-based stress system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable customers</strong> with weird requests and weirder appearances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A\u00a0<strong>variety of wasteland locations</strong> with their own <strong>dangers and monsters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense</strong>, atmospheric <strong>gameplay</strong> with a <strong>darkly humorous</strong> tone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
